OmniOrchestrator .gitignore
A comprehensive gitignore for a MERN (MongoDB, Express, React, Node) project.
-------------------------------------------------------------------
GENERAL - Files to ignore in the root of the project
-------------------------------------------------------------------
IDE and editor directories and files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

Log files
.log
npm-debug.log
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

-------------------------------------------------------------------
SERVER (Node.js / Express) - Specific ignores for the /server folder
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Dependency directories - This is the most important one!
server/node_modules/

Environment variables file - CRITICAL for security
This file contains database credentials and API keys. NEVER commit this.
server/.env

Production build folder (if you were to have one)
server/dist/

Google Cloud Service Account Key File - CRITICAL for security
This file grants access to your Google Cloud project.
server/services/vertex-service-account.json

Temporary script file for creating the admin user
server/createAdmin.js

-------------------------------------------------------------------
CLIENT (React) - Specific ignores for the /client folder
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Dependency directories
client/node_modules/

Production build folder
client/build/

Environment variables file for the client (if you create one)
client/.env
client/.env.local
client/.env.development
client/.env.test
client/.env.production

Test coverage folder
client/coverage/